window.docContents[49].resolve({"/Bound-variables___-lambdas___-quantifiers___-define-fun/#BoundVars":{"contents":"open Cvc Typed\nvariable [Ω]\n\n\nCvc.lean's typed API types bound variables just like it types terms.\n\nA bound variable.\n\nIt also provides a type for collections of BVars.\n\nA typed-list of BVars.\n\nAs long as this list of bound variables (and their type) is known statically, functions such as\nTerm.lambda is able to deconstruct it and infer the type of the corresponding function.\n\n\n\n\n\n","context":"Cvc.lean -- High-Level API for CVC5","header":"7. Bound variables: lambdas, quantifiers, define-fun","id":"/Bound-variables___-lambdas___-quantifiers___-define-fun/#BoundVars"}});